msgstr "LogicalConstraint 成员数量约束"

msgctxt "https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/LogicalConstraintMemberCountConstraint|skos:definition"
msgid "A closed-world integrity constraint: a gmeow:LogicalConstraint combines at least two gmeow:logicConstraintMember constraints."
msgstr "闭世界完整性约束：gmeow:LogicalConstraint 组合至少两个 gmeow:logicConstraintMember 约束。"
